<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore to liberalise tug services from July 1.</title>
<headline>Singapore to liberalise tug services from July 1.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Port of Singapore Authority (PSA) will no longer be the sole provider of tug services from July 1, the Maritime Port Authority (MPA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in a joint statement with the PSA shipyards would be able to order tug services from operators other than PSA to move vessels in the shipyards.</p>
<p>&quot;The liberalisation of tug services will result in greater flexibility to the operations of the shipyards,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
